hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2970","Narrated to us 'Ali ibn Khashram, who said: 'Isa ibn Yunus informed us, from 'Ubaydullah (ibn Abi Ziyad), who said: Al-Qasim ibn Muhammad narrated to us, from 'Aishah (RA), who said:\nThe Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, *\"Indeed, the Tawaf around the House, (walking) between Safa and Marwah, and stoning the Jamarat have been prescribed for the establishment of the remembrance of Allah.\"*\n\n**CHAPTER:**"
